  "col_left L1: the entry angulus latitudinis et longitudinis of p. 376 goes on here; ☾ is the sign of the Moon (Luna), here and in L2, L3 and L5.",
  "col_left L9: «observatae *43*(adn.» is printed with a thin space before 43 and none after it.",
  "col_left L9: the macron of the ā of «al-Battānī» is printed broken in two flat pieces at one height (2.4 and 1.2 points wide), as on p. 373; the ī has its bar (2.3 by 1.0 points). Measured with macron_audit.py.",
  "col_left L12: the h of «hegirae» is printed with its two feet joined and its arch broken, so that it looks like a b; it has no dot below (the ḥ of ar-rāmiḥ, right column L39, has its dot 1.3 points below the baseline).",
  "col_left L13: «VIII» (the page viii of the preface, where note 5 speaks of the beginning of the years of the hegira) is printed in full capitals, where the index sets roman page numbers in small capitals; transcribed as printed.",
  "col_left L20: a speck in the margin before «nus» is not transcribed.",
  "col_left L24: a short slanting stroke above the semicolon after «210-211» is not transcribed.",
  "col_left L34: the guillemets around «anni Coptorum» are printed as small solid wedges, as on pp. 366, 370 and 374.",
  "col_right L11, L12: «ἄφεσις» and «ἀφέτης» are Greek; the first α carries the smooth breathing and the acute in one sort, the second the smooth breathing (the same breathing as in ἀκτινοβολία, p. 375).",
  "col_right L14: «Bienevitz» is printed so; transcribed as printed.",
  "col_right L35: the hyphen of «265-266» is printed short, like a point at mid height (1.2 points).",
  "col_right L35: «{sc:lxxv} ac II, {sc:xvii}» is printed with thin spaces only.",
  "col_right L36: a speck above the c of «etc.» is not transcribed.",
  "col_right L43: a speck (0.6 by 0.6 point) above the u of the first «arcus» is not an accent; not transcribed."
